+        "finite-field family by GF(2) Gaussian elimination in O(r^2 d) bit "
+        "operations; the hard-preset reference run is measured by selftest, while "
+        "the shared-syndrome change of variables uses exactly 3d = 240 XORs."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 121,
+}
