+STRUCTURAL_HINT: str = (
+    "The three permuted vertex spaces share one linear syndrome, so XOR "
+    "cancellation survives every displayed coordinate change."
+)
+PLACEBO_HINT: str = (
+    "The three binary vertex spaces use precise conventions, so careful "
+    "bookkeeping matters throughout the calculation."
+)
