The required 200,000 trials have completed, and the remaining time is in the canonical-key proof: 20 unrelated instances × composed finite-field relabelings. I’m letting that finish because this is the only gate that detects a fake seed/render hash and it must be demonstrated, not asserted.
diff --git a/gen_1608_04838.py b/gen_1608_04838.py
