   501	Note from our construction, $|e_{j+1}\cap A_s'|=1$ for $s\in [k-1]$ and $|e_{j+1}\cap W_k'|\le 1$. So 
   502	$$\Delta_{j+1} \leq \Delta_j - (k-1)(k-1) + 1 = \Delta_j - k(k -2) \leq \Delta_j - k,$$
